// Oracle: a diagnostic raised while checking an IMPORTED module must name that
// module's own file and line. Imported modules are lexed and parsed on their own
// buffer, never spliced into the concatenated unit, so their AstTree used to keep
// srcmap == null and every diagnostic inside them degraded to a bare byte offset.
